cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "atomipy: Atomistic Topology Operations in Python"
message: "If you use atomipy in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Holmboe
    given-names: Michael
    email: michael.holmboe@umu.se
    affiliation: "Umeå University, Sweden"
version: "0.98"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mholmboe/atomipy"
url: "https://github.com/mholmboe/atomipy"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolbox for building and analysing atomistic models of minerals and
  molecular systems, and for generating topology files for the MINFF and CLAYFF
  force fields. A lightweight port of the MATLAB atom Toolbox.
keywords:
  - molecular modelling
  - molecular dynamics
  - clay minerals
  - force field
  - topology
  - MINFF
  - CLAYFF
  - GROMACS
  - Python
